<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions - Pakistan</p>
<p>Karachi, June 10 - Vessels waiting off port: one container vessel, waiting one day and one loader, waiting two days. Four other vessels waiting off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
